      "name": "Where is Apohenia headed?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Apohenia is building, in order: a compliance graph of versioned title and registration rules; Deal Packet Checker, the packet-readiness review that reads a dealer's deal jacket against those rules before filing; DealDesk, which constructs the deal so the packet is right the first time; and a managed network of licensed title services that take posted work. The target is the roughly 9,000 to 15,000 Texas independent dealers under 30 deals a month who cannot justify a full-time title clerk. Only Deal Packet Checker is in build today; the rest is direction, not a promise."
      }
